{% doc %}
  THE single source of the Dandy guarantee sentence (spec S-07 / E-092 / E-093).

  Rules (enforced by scripts/release-scan.sh):
  - The sentence text may exist in exactly ONE place: the capture below. Every surface
    renders this snippet; never retype the sentence anywhere else.
  - 2026-09-13: the first-order / no-return default is retired. Real terms (FOUNDER-DECISIONS items 17 and 23):
    any order, 30 days, the jars are returned; terms live on /pages/contact?view=dandy2-returns. The sentence is the
    approved PDP guarantee line. data-copy-status stays "pending-legal" for the release scan. Signing the sentence = replacing the capture content and
    the copy status, once, here.

  @param {string} [context] - Optional marker for instrumentation ("buy-box", "recap", "final-cta", "faq").
{% enddoc %}
{%- comment -%}
  Renders the recommended default wording so no raw token is ever shown to a shopper.
  data-copy-status stays "pending-legal", so the release scan still blocks launch until
  David + legal sign the final terms here (this capture is the only place to change it).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture dandy_guarantee_sentence -%}Every order is covered by our 30-day, 100% satisfaction guarantee.{%- endcapture -%}
<p class="dandy-guarantee-line" data-guarantee-line data-guarantee-context="{{ context | default: 'unset' }}" data-copy-status="pending-legal">{{ dandy_guarantee_sentence | strip }}</p>
